sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Src as Instructions
    participant Dep as Dependence graph
    participant List as List scheduler
    participant Bun as Bundles
    Src->>Dep: build edges — true, anti, and output dependences
    Dep->>Dep: annotate each edge with its latency
    Dep->>List: ready list — instructions whose predecessors have retired
    loop each cycle
        List->>List: pick by priority, usually longest path to the exit
        List->>Bun: pack into this cycle's slots, respecting resource limits
        Note over List,Bun: a slot that cannot be filled becomes a no-op — that is the cost of a static schedule
    end
    Bun-->>Src: scheduled bundles
    Note over Dep,Bun: the hardware does no reordering, so the compiler must be right
